 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Billing and Cost Management Data Exports API (2023-11-26). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Exports are stored definitions: the query is kept as text and never run, no table is read, nothing is written to Amazon S3 and no file, refresh or delivery happens. The export reports no ExportStatus and no LastRefreshedAt because nothing ever runs. GetTable and ListTables return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501 because the table schemas are AWS-owned data. QueryStatement must be a SELECT statement but is not parsed, so unknown tables and columns are accepted; the S3 bucket, prefix and Region are stored without being checked or contacted. Export names are not unique. UpdateExport replaces the definition, so it needs the full Export and drops a Description the request omits, and an ExportArn inside Export must equal the ExportArn being updated. Exports per Region are a local limit, not a Service Quota. The data exports service is available in us-east-1 only in AWS; the simulator serves it in every Region it serves.",
  "title": "AWS Billing and Cost Management Data Exports (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2023-11-26"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
